graph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198250/extras/e9cb1a5a7460c99f1c443d115d0f62d1.poster.avif?t=1774101416\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198250/extras/e9cb1a5a7460c99f1c443d115d0f62d1.webm?t=1774101416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198250/extras/e9cb1a5a7460c99f1c443d115d0f62d1.mp4?t=1774101416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage Your Supplies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resources are finite, and waste is punished. Loot the facility, craft what you need, and ration ammunition carefully. Your survival depends on managing both your own supplies and those of your squad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198250/extras/06f237c8cd4874c1aa7fd9d4add8cdd9.poster.avif?t=1774101416\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198250/extras/06f237c8cd4874c1aa7fd9d4add8cdd9.webm?t=1774101416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198250/extras/06f237c8cd4874c1aa7fd9d4add8cdd9.mp4?t=1774101416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Arsenal of Control</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight back with an arsenal of over 10 firearms, crafted using futuristic tech. Deploy grenades to break formations. Use a compact recon drone to scan ahead, revealing threats, loot and most importantly: Your way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay 